		{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"# 第1关：安全计算器\n\n- ast 解析 + 白名单求值\n- 拒绝 eval / 函数调用 / 变量\n- 测试：7 个\n\n✅ 已完成","x":40,"y":50,"width":280,"height":220},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"# 第3关：命令行\n\n- main() 交互循环\n- --trace 显示执行轨迹\n- format_trace 纯函数\n\n✅ 已完成","x":680,"y":50,"width":280,"height":220},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"# 第4关：工具注册系统\n\n- 4A：Tool + ToolRegistry\n- 4B：calculator 注册为 Tool\n- 4C：Agent 迁移，删除旧 TOOLS\n\n✅ 已完成","x":1000,"y":50,"width":320,"height":220},
		{"id":"s5a","type":"text","text":"# 第5A关：ThreadState\n\n- 会话状态数据模型\n- append / extend / snapshot\n- 11 个新测试\n\n✅ 刚完成","x":1360,"y":50,"width":280,"height":220},
		{"id":"s5b","type":"text","text":"# 后续阶段\n\n- 5B：Agent 接入 ThreadState\n- 接入真实 LLM\n- 多工具\n\n🚧 待开始","x":1680,"y":50,"width":240,"height":220},
		{"id":"a1","type":"text","text":"**表现层 · CLI**（cli.py）\n读输入、打印答案、--trace 轨迹。不做任何决策。","x":700,"y":450,"width":560,"height":90},
		{"id":"a2","type":"text","text":"**调度层 · Agent**（agent.py）\n循环：用户 → 模型决策 → 调工具 → 回喂 → 最终答案。依赖注入 Model + ToolRegistry。","x":700,"y":580,"width":560,"height":90},
		{"id":"a3","type":"text","text":"**决策层 · Model**（models.py）\nMessage / ToolCall / FinalAnswer + Model Protocol。FakeModel 确定性模拟。","x":380,"y":710,"width":500,"height":90},
		{"id":"a4","type":"text","text":"**执行层 · ToolRegistry**（tools.py）\nTool + Registry + 异常族 → calculator_handler → calculator（AST 白名单）","x":1040,"y":710,"width":560,"height":90},
		{"id":"a5","type":"text","text":"**状态层 · ThreadState**（thread_state.py）· 新增\n会话消息历史、snapshot、类型校验","x":700,"y":840,"width":560,"height":60},
		{"id":"note_cmd","type":"text","text":"**常用命令**：`uv run python -m unittest discover -s tests -v`（全部测试） · `uv run mini-deerflow --trace`（带轨迹运行） · 当前 47 个测试全绿","x":0,"y":1440,"width":1960,"height":100},
